      "NodeType": "CodeBlockNode",
      "Code": "Italijan = Revit.Family.Types(Revit.Family.ByName(\"Italijan\"));\n\nPod = DSCore.List.GetItemAtIndex(Italijan, 0);\nZid = DSCore.List.GetItemAtIndex(Italijan, 1);\nPlafon = DSCore.List.GetItemAtIndex(Italijan, 2);",
