      "NodeType": "CodeBlockNode",
      "Code": "point1 = Revit.FamilyInstance.Location(t1);\nnum1 = Autodesk.Point.X(point1);\nnum2 = Autodesk.Point.Y(point1);\nt2 = -2000;\nnum3 = Math.Sum(t2);\npoint2 = Autodesk.Point.ByCoordinates(num1, num2, num3);\naxis = Autodesk.Line.ByStartPointEndPoint(point1, point2);\nangle = Math.DegreesToRadians(t3);\n\nelementid = DSCore.List.Flatten(Get.ValueAtIndex(OUT, 0), -1);\n\na = DSCore.List.Flatten(elementid, 10);\n\nb = DSCore.List.Flatten(axis, 10);\n\nc = DSCore.List.Flatten(angle, 10);",
